abstract: >
  Independent Python implementation and simulation study of a
  movable antenna and intelligent reflecting surface based wireless
  communication system for coverage enhancement. The implementation
  includes channel modeling, movable antenna positioning, IRS phase
  optimization, alternating optimization, and simulation-based
  performance evaluation.

